Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,開動啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好恰！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鄰居們送的 多吃一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:19.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,每一種都很好吃 嘴巴停不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,吃在秋 這下要命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“吃在秋”是什麼意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:30.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就是指秋季食物豐收 令人食指大動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天氣也涼爽舒適 適合大部分活動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有運動在秋 藝術在秋的說法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就要修煉在秋！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:41.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呼 喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:45.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 啪嗒啪嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:47.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空是散步在秋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:52.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讀很多書 就是學在秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《天空的理論與科學》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:55.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主要不要跟我一起讀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市 大家的畫書大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我要參加這個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是畫書在秋！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:05.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗市 大家的畫書大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:08.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是之前真白同學參過的比賽...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:13.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 上次很遺憾沒有得獎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:15.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,又要參加啊... 也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:17.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我要再次挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:21.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的目標是得獎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}真白與孟達的秋語
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(960,960)}紋田
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:06.25,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我恰飽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:07.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空吃了好多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子鼓成球了 感覺就要破了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚 好難受...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆吃太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:22.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華姐也跟我們吃得差不多啊 為什麼就沒事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:26.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,從小時候起 我就特別能吃來著！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:29.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了 胃是連通了異次元嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:31.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}目標得獎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊也很難受呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:40.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 這種不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:47.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊... 畫書的主題定不下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,歡樂一點的比較好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:52.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還是該重視衝擊力？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:55.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,或者美式催淚的感動劇情？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:04:01.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白畫過很多畫書了 從中挑選一本參賽怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:04.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣是不行的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.25,0:04:08.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,參賽者肯定會畫出很厲害的畫書 我也必須用新作發起挑戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是這樣的嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學衝勁十足呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:16.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我卯足了衝勁 燃起了幹勁！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:21.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就是完全不知道該畫什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊 要是還沒有什麼靈感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:30.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,時間就不斷流逝 地球都骨碌骨碌轉上100圈了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,地球？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,骨碌骨碌！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:38.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 你太用死勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:40.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀放鬆一下嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}（金屬卡住的聲音...）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好硬！根本按不動！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:48.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真是少見啊 小白居然會這樣魂不守舍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這證明了她是真心想要做好一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 紅葉子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:57.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是楓葉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:05.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是紅葉的季節 會有很多各種顏色的葉子飄落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,各種葉子... 想要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:12.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們去公園撿葉子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:16.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意啊！真白同學也一起去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:21.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你們去吧 我得思考畫書的主題...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去換換心情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:27.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們出發
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:30.78,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路順風
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達老弟 麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(755,975)}紋田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 久等了 當心不要撒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都跟你說了當心！... 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果汁...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？沒弄濕吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 我幫你重新倒一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 大姐 這裡我會收拾的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡再來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫誰叔叔啊 小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是待客粗魯的話 就會影響收益
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打工錢也會減少 飯錢 房錢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你了 孟達老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都來幫忙 真的是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那還不是我想賺很多打工錢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個月的生活費也是緊巴巴的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息一下吧 這個你嚐嚐看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以嗎？謝謝老闆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋... 我可是暗塌谷帝國的虛蜢達大人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本該是用我華麗的作戰計劃\N\N打倒Precure 旗開得勝 走上人生巔峰的...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要想一個能夠回到暗塌谷帝國的方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤烘山芋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山芋 烘山芋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 可好吃了 卡疤烘山芋哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤大伯 我要一份
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們又來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰讓卡疤烘山芋超好吃的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 對吧 對吧 來 給你們個大的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵 那傢伙也是有家無歸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悠閒得跟小鬼打鬧 真是落魄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是也一樣嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 我也想吃烘山芋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再這麼下去就完了 會一路跌到谷底...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像落葉一樣飄零 最後...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要辦法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:58.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:02.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好多葉子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有各種顏色的呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:06.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就像落葉的毛毯一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:08.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅葉鋪滿地呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:11.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:13.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,給！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,給我的嗎？謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:18.53,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:22.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有著各種顏色和形狀 沒有兩個是相同的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,每一個都很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀這裡放鬆下來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:37.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去跟小空一起撿葉子 你慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:41.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 努力啊！我們為你加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:42.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:46.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那丫頭 又在畫畫書了嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很開心是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 落葉的畫書 可能不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:08.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,該講個什麼故事呢... 主題要怎麼確定呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.97,0:09:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}芳醇紅茶 使用國產牛奶 芳醇的茶葉芳香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥！你怎麼在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在餐車打工 正好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝吧 很暖的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:28.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落葉？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:36.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 這次又舉辦畫書的比賽了 我準備要投稿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:41.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次的結果不行 這次一定要得獎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為畫書作家... 我記得這是你的夢想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:49.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！我正在努力實現夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很努力的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來粉碎你的這個夢想！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 也有著即使努力了 也不如意的情況呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,付出努力 實現夢想 說法是沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是拚命了 實現了夢想的人 其實就一小部分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能獲得勝利的 都是有著強大力量或者才能的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的無論多努力 終究也無法實現夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以還是別做夢比較好 只會留下痛苦的回憶...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正最後也會像落葉一樣飄零 泯然於世...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你有過痛苦的經歷嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:58.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？那傢伙是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛...痛苦？我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:17.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥 無精打采的... 很苦惱的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是為了畫作在煩惱嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭！完全沒這回事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是... 看著落葉有感而生罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綠葉枯萎了 落到地上 被踐踏...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,落葉才不是毫不起眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:45.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,樹木褪去葉子 是為了度過寒冬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:50.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,目的是盡量減少與冷空氣的接觸面積
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 那不就是... 被樹給拋棄了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:59.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 落葉會化作土壤 給樹供給營養
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:04.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,枯葉的顏色也很漂亮 即使掉落了也很鼓舞人心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜歡落葉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:18.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥？孟達大哥 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.38,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:26.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 真不錯 落葉藝術！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,傑作啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:30.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:32.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一吹就飛走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:33.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,傑... 作...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:35.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:39.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,降溫了 我們回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？真白同學呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說我很痛苦？搞的很理解我一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都懂我什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我就納悶你這長相挺臉熟的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊 虛蜢達
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一... 一人之下大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.23,0:13:06.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:11.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼還悠然自得的活著？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你就這副德行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.39,0:13:21.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,本就是個沒有任何能力的末尾 還不懂得放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:27.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你那不斷掙扎的樣子 丟人 礙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄了綁架公主的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,執著於Precure 結果還被打敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:39.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有能力的人 沒有存在的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼要做這種事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:57.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是抹消沒有價值的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這麼說孟達大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:05.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你討論這傢伙 也是浪費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:09.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:31.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:33.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:37.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:38.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:39.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.92,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.92,CurePri,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:30.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.33,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.33,CurePri,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:30.68,CurePri,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:30.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:30.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:49.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:49.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:56.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,遼闊拂遠的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}稜鏡愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壯闊飛揚的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1095,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}蝴蝶愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:21.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}威愛愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:02:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,準備...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:29.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沖！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:29.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Go！
